      "seed": 384170057,
      "version": 213,
      "versionNonce": 1530626505,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1787002097358,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Create Mock Data (Our \"Production\")\n- we will create fake data for services, metrics,\nlogs. \n- services: frontend, api, database\n- Mock health status\n- Mock metrics\n- Mock logs",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Create Mock Data (Our \"Production\")\n- we will create fake data for services, metrics,\nlogs. \n- services: frontend, api, database\n- Mock health status\n- Mock metrics\n- Mock logs",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
