      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0n",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 710076201,
      "version": 121,
      "versionNonce": 2072301609,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1787002184506,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Create functions that the agent can call\n- check_service_health(service)\n- get_metrics(service)\n- get_logs(service)",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Create functions that the agent can call\n- check_service_health(service)\n- get_metrics(service)\n- get_logs(service)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "7oT8bh3tT1cbusJJgI9PS",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1929.2944985033146,
      "y": 1762.7065289814905,
      "width": 602.0557250976562,
      "height": 420,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0o",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1316123849,
      "version": 370,
      "versionNonce": 1365849513,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1787002341273,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "3. Define Tool schemas for Agent\nWe describe tools so LLM knows how to use\nthem (function calling). \nWe will create a list of tools with schemas\n\n4. Build the Agent Loop (Main App)\nThe agent will:\n- read user question\n- ask LLM what to do\n- Execute tool if requested\n- send result back to LLM\n- repeat until final answer",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "3. Define Tool schemas for Agent\nWe describe tools so LLM knows how to use\nthem (function calling). \nWe will create a list of tools with schemas\n\n4. Build the Agent Loop (Main App)\nThe agent will:\n- read user question\n- ask LLM what to do\n- Execute tool if requested\n- send result back to LLM\n- repeat until final answer",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
