      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1787002430245,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "5. If we have time, we will add more tools like:\n- get_top_errors(service)\n- restart_service(service)\n- get_dependencies(service)\n- .....",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "5. If we have time, we will add more tools like:\n- get_top_errors(service)\n- restart_service(service)\n- get_dependencies(service)\n- .....",
